  "headline": "Potassium chloride is not on FDA's current shortage list; the earlier shortage posted 2021-11-02 is resolved",
  "headline_cites": ["D27"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show potassium chloride is not on the current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; the earlier shortage first posted 2021-11-02 has been resolved.",
      "cites": ["D27"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspected multiple registered plants for this drug, including Baxter Healthcare Corporation (FEI 1416980) with an OAI classification on 2026-04-02 and a Warning Letter on 2026-09-29, Baxter (FEI 2649614) with VAI classifications in 2018 and 2023, Baxter (FEI 2618677) with multiple OAI and VAI inspections from 2010 through 2024, APL HEALTHCARE LIMITED (FEI 3011895410) with VAI inspections in 2020 and 2025, Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1021343) with OAI and VAI inspections from 2010 through 2019 and a recent NAI in 2025, and Pfizer Healthcare India Private Limited (FEI 3008316085) with an OAI in 2019 and a Warning Letter in 2020.",
      "cites": ["E15", "E17", "E18", "E21", "E22", "E27", "E28", "E30", "E32", "E34", "E35", "E36", "E37", "E42", "E43", "E47", "E49", "E51", "E52", "E53", "E54", "E55", "E57", "E63", "E64", "E65"]
    },
    {
      "text": "No FDA action at a registered plant is recorded before the 2021-11-02 shortage posting that would establish a confirmed link for that episode.",
      "cites": ["D10", "D11", "D12", "D13", "D14", "D16", "D18", "D20", "D21", "D22", "D23", "D24", "D25"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 35 bags of the 29.8 g/1000 mL 50 mL presentation at 13 per day, giving 2.7 days on hand, while Corvale General holds 215 bags at 13.1 per day, giving 16.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to transfer 31 bags of the 29.8 g/1000 mL 50 mL presentation from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would leave Corvale General with 14 days and bring Corvale East to 5 days.",
      "cites": ["D28"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East and Corvale General also hold 750 mg tablets (22 and 19.5 days respectively) and Corvale Lakeside holds 6.1 days, with secondary transfer options ranked for tablets.",
      "cites": ["D3", "D4", "D5", "D29", "D30"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Additional presentations include 14.9 g/100 mL 250 mL at Corvale East (8.9 days), Corvale General (9.7 days), and Corvale Lakeside (19.2 days), and 149 mg/mL 20 mL vials at Corvale General (16.3 days).",
      "cites": ["D6", "D7", "D8", "D9"]
    }
  ]
}
